malicious_snippets.code_snippet:
Vulnerable XML parsing logic that does not disable external entity resolution, e.g.:

SAXParserFactory factory = SAXParserFactory.newInstance();
factory.setFeature("http://xml.org/sax/features/external-general-entities", true);
factory.setFeature("http://xml.org/sax/features/external-parameter-entities", true);
SAXParser parser = factory.newSAXParser();
parser.parse(input, handler);

Improper input validation in XML parsing routines, such as missing limits on entity expansion or recursion depth, e.g.:

SAXParser parser = factory.newSAXParser();
parser.parse(input, handler); // No checks on input size, entity count, or recursion depth
